    {
      "id": "nested-reasoning-forwarded",
      "classification": "confirmed_transport_defect",
      "detail": "Nested MiniMax M2.7 agent content retains a leading think block while the root provider strips it. This forwards reasoning into root conversation, tool observations and private host traces. Scan of the two original ten-case cohorts found 26 affected Agent results across 11 M2.7 skill/baseline execution traces; zero in M3.1 observations. The adapter now removes one balanced leading block and rejects malformed boundaries, retaining final answer bytes, tools and usage."
    },
    {
      "id": "criterion-attribution",
      "classification": "observed_judge_error_not_proven_single_cause",
      "detail": "Original research-only DB summaries assess researcher JSON and mock-data legitimacy instead of the requested criterion. New same-context original approval votes are yes/yes/no; answer-only Agent observations produce nine yes votes across three criteria. These small samples do not prove causal repair or reliability. Grounding and credential original-context votes are also all yes in this diagnostic."
    },
    {
      "id": "parser",
      "classification": "no_disagreement_in_diagnostic",
      "detail": "All 33 adapter verdicts equal strict JSON-parsed verdicts; all calls returned a complete JSON object with no provider error. Original per-sample raw responses were not retained, so this does not retrospectively prove original parser behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": "grounding-false-accept",
      "classification": "confirmed_remaining_judge_failure",
      "detail": "The original thin-data output still invents sender research and experience. Fresh full-context diagnostic votes are no/yes/yes, so majority voting still falsely accepts it. The original three yes votes and incomplete case remain unchanged."
    },
    {
      "id": "instruction-quotation",
      "classification": "observed_variability",
      "detail": "The unchanged quotation-negative output now receives three no votes, versus three original yes votes. The exact guardrail occurs in the loaded skill. This diagnostic never upgrades the original automatic pass/manual rejection into qualification."
    },
    {
      "id": "observation-ablation",
      "classification": "diagnostic_caveat",
      "detail": "The no-observations arm removes legitimate source/title evidence. Its predeclared yes expectations are retained but cannot be used as a calibrated correctness score: two grounding no votes correctly identify facts absent from the remaining prompt. Aggregate 26/33 agreement is a protocol result, not a judge accuracy estimate. Observations must not be dropped from future qualification."
    }
